#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:11
msgid ""
"Security endpoints represent the source and destination objects in firewall "
"rules and security policies within a network security integration. Endpoints"
" can include IP addresses, IP ranges, network segments, security groups, or "
"service profiles that define what traffic is allowed or denied."
msgstr ""
"Seguridad endpoints represent el origen y destino objects en firewall reglas"
" y security políticas dentro de un network security integration. Endpoints "
"puede incluir IP direcciones, IP ranges, network segments, security groups, "
"o servicio profiles ese define qué traffic es permitido o denied."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:13
msgid ""
"In |morpheus|, security endpoints are managed as part of the firewall "
"configuration within a security server integration. They provide the "
"building blocks for defining security policies and access control."
msgstr ""
"En |morpheus|, security endpoints son administrado como part del firewall "
"configuración dentro de un security servidor integration. They proporcionar "
"el building blocks para defining security políticas y acceso control."

